{"id":"H1666","lemma":"גֶּ֫תֶר","transliteration":"geter","sayIt":"ge-ter","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Gether","meaning":"A man of the Syrians living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.10.23;\nson of: Aram (H0758);\nbrother of: Uz (H5780), Hul (H2343) and Mash (H4851)\n§ Gether = \"fear\"\nthe third in order of the sons of Aram","glosses":["gether"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-10","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"Gether","kjv":"and Gether"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"Gether","kjv":"and Gether"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 10:23","note":"The sons of Aram were: Uz, Hul, Gether, and Mash.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 1:17","note":"The sons of Shem: Elam, Asshur, Arpachshad, Lud, Aram, Uz, Hul, Gether, and Meshech.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0758","lemma":"אֲרָם","transliteration":"aram","gloss":"Aram"},{"id":"H5780","lemma":"עוּץ","transliteration":"uts","gloss":"Uz"},{"id":"H2343","lemma":"חוּל","transliteration":"chul","gloss":"Hul"},{"id":"H4851","lemma":"מַשׁ","transliteration":"mash","gloss":"Mash"},{"id":"H4902","lemma":"מֶ֫שֶׁךְ","transliteration":"meshekh","gloss":"Meshech"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}